From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dcomp: Windows.UI.Composition AmbientLight, DistantLight, PointLight, SpotLight

ICompositor2's four light creators were E_NOTIMPL. New lights.c: the lights (ICompositionLight/2/3 and each kind's interfaces) keep every property with Windows' defaults (white, intensity 1, constant attenuation 1, direction -z, enabled), animatable where Windows animates them, and their Targets and ExclusionsFromTargets as VisualUnorderedCollections (IIterable<Visual>). The renderer does not light visuals yet. Interface identity per windows-rs 0.30 (MIT OR Apache-2.0).
---
--- a/dlls/dcomp/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/dcomp/Makefile.in
@@ -12,6 +12,7 @@
 	device.c \
 	expression.c \
 	implicit.c \
+	lights.c \
 	shapes.c \
 	surface.c \
 	version.rc
--- a/dlls/dcomp/composition.c
+++ b/dlls/dcomp/composition.c
@@ -4995,7 +4995,6 @@
         return E_NOTIMPL;                                                                          \
     }
 
